# Collatz

Start with `attacks/collatz/AGENT.md` and the relevant proof map.
Collatz is an active laboratory programme alongside Juggler.

- Specify sign, shortcut/accelerated map, domain and hypotheses.
- Distinguish codes, formal words and actual integer orbits.
- Use the seven evidence labels from `docs/README.md`. Finite checks do not
  prove termination. A compiled implication may still have an open premise.
- Register named results in the claim ledger and their proof map; do not
  generate a new numbered milestone by default.
- Import from `research.collatz`, `research.syracuse` or
  `research.collatz_finite_descent`, never a top-level compatibility package.
